Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 04:16:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] S2B market terrain map: a price-only, book-independent
 enumeration of every significant directional episode, so reach has a fixed
 denominator before anything is scanned or selected. Reuses the ratified
 basis-3 construction from cluster_profiler with K and E from dots_thresholds
 (mechanism D, rolling-2500, day-refreshed); no local percentile and no
 constant. Swept over W in {15,30} x K in {p85,p90} with E at p75 and every
 row and summary line carries its own grid cell and eligibility mask, because
 counts move 2-4x across the grid while the up/down ratio does not. S5B now
 scores coverage against that terrain PER DIRECTION via
 selection.coverage_by_direction, which is how directional balance arrives
 without a quota; coverage stays after survival, FailConc and DepthYield in
 the lexicographic order and is never promoted. S9 reports REACH for the
 selected book with the incumbent alongside, replacing the hardcoded
 incumbent-only line. F12 and F13 now print an unambiguous COMPLETE line
 naming every artifact. The forward-looking boundary is stated in the module
 header and in every artifact header.

